    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The executive implementing a strategic pivot executed a required organizational transformation, with thousands of positions being cut from the workforce. Physical footprints are being optimized for a new operational model as certain locations are closing as part of the reorganization. This business strategy involves severance offered to affected staff, a necessary corporate change aimed at product development acceleration. The tax-software company frames this as a pivotal shift, though the job elimination signals deeper organizational downsizing.",
